Here is an example of a most simple loadable module.  This example has
the different includes needed to compile V4 and V5 modules.  Missing
the *_attributes structure or the *_configure routine will cause missing
symbols.  Also not include all the correct header files will also cause
missing symbols.

You should really only copy the loadable module into the /subsys or
/var/subsys directories.


Sean Davidson
Compaq Tru64 UNIX Release Engineering


