patch kit.  For example, V5.1 *unpatched* LSM stripes may look as if
they're doing lots of useful I/O, such as when you look at disk-LED
"blinkage" and the disk I/O stats from "collect."  But actual I/O
through the database might be terrible.  Installation- and
configuration-specific.  The latest V5.1 patch kit fixes this problem.

