Actually if you read the man page for prpasswd you will find there are a two fields

u_minlen
u_minchosen

If you set them in /etc/auth/system/default - then that is the default for all users on the
system.  If you only set them in particular user profiles, then the values will only be in
effect for those profiles.  In order to determine whether they are set for the user profile
use the "edauth -g <username>" command.  Or to edit the entry - just remove the "-g".


