"MIKA" <mika@robot.cvo> wrote in message news:<3b209d0e$0$197$4d4efb8e@news.be.uu.net>...
> How i can change The resolutions screen actually
> VGA 640x480 to SVGA 256 colors 1024x768

(Assuming Tru64 5.x)

edit your /var/X11/Xserver.conf file.  At the bottom, put this:

! you specify command line arguments here
args <
        -pn -screen 1024x768 -depth 8 -vsync 75
>

(you may need to adjust the vsync value based on your monitor.)

HTH

