> Please install the shells "tcsh" and/or "bash" from
> the sources or the binaries from the "Open Source
> Software Collection" CD from Compaq.

Command completion and history settings are just shell config settings.
The default shells will do this without having to install new ones.

For sh/ksh just use set -o emacs and arrow keys work for history and ESC
for completion. 

For csh just use set filec to get ESC to complete files and set
editmode=emacs for command recall via the arrows. 

These are all explained in the man pages for ksh and csh.

